00:00:07,665 --> 00:00:09,025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

3
00:01:36,785 --> 00:01:38,905
ADAPTED FROM THE EARLY SPRING ON JJWXC.NET
AUTHOR: GU NIANG BIE KU

4
00:01:53,065 --> 00:01:54,105
Lumi.

5
00:01:54,985 --> 00:01:55,945
I want to work in this place.

6
00:01:59,505 --> 00:02:01,185
NORTHWESTERN CULTURAL TOURISM
DEVELOPMENT PROJECT, BUSINESS DIVISION ONE

7
00:02:03,105 --> 00:02:04,465
Northwestern China?

8
00:02:04,545 --> 00:02:06,145
That's so far away from here.

9
00:02:06,225 --> 00:02:09,545
And the project will run
for 14 months, not 14 days.

10
00:02:11,385 --> 00:02:13,625
I know. But I have made up my mind.

11
00:02:14,305 --> 00:02:15,505
Tracy told me that

12
00:02:15,585 --> 00:02:18,105
while I passed all the requirements,
I still needed a bit more.

13
00:02:18,625 --> 00:02:20,305
I have never managed
any S+ projects of highly importance.

14
00:02:20,385 --> 00:02:22,345
This is a great opportunity.

15
00:02:22,425 --> 00:02:23,505
It's all I need now.

16
00:02:30,545 --> 00:02:32,025
Same here.

17
00:02:40,065 --> 00:02:41,465
You have not given up yet?

18
00:02:42,625 --> 00:02:44,465
The boy is mine.

19
00:02:44,985 --> 00:02:46,305
He saved my life.

20
00:02:47,065 --> 00:02:49,705
It's only right for me to marry him.

21
00:02:50,305 --> 00:02:53,625
What? When did he save your life?

22
00:02:55,345 --> 00:02:57,985
My ex harassed me a while ago.

23
00:02:58,065 --> 00:02:59,385
We almost got physical.

24
00:02:59,465 --> 00:03:02,185
And he suddenly appeared to save me.

25
00:03:02,865 --> 00:03:06,025
He fought two enemies alone,
and he did not lose.

26
00:03:06,105 --> 00:03:10,385
So manly. He looks like a nerd,

27
00:03:10,465 --> 00:03:12,465
but how can he be
so handsome when he fights?

28
00:03:12,545 --> 00:03:15,105
His abs. His posture. I was like…

29
00:03:22,825 --> 00:03:23,905
Did he look at me?

30
00:03:25,025 --> 00:03:25,865
Did he look at me?

31
00:03:28,705 --> 00:03:29,945
He did.

32
00:03:47,105 --> 00:03:50,225
ANOTHER LEAP OF FAITH

33
00:03:59,225 --> 00:04:00,225
Come in.

34
00:04:03,425 --> 00:04:04,545
Luke.

35
00:04:06,185 --> 00:04:07,025
Take a seat.

36
00:04:13,265 --> 00:04:14,105
Luke.

37
00:04:16,705 --> 00:04:18,985
I would like to apply
to join the Northwestern

38
00:04:19,064 --> 00:04:21,145
Cultural Tourism
Development Project team next month.

39
00:04:23,705 --> 00:04:24,905
That is a tough subject.

40
00:04:25,505 --> 00:04:27,265
You only return here
for two days per month.

41
00:04:28,865 --> 00:04:29,945
Still, I want to join.

42
00:04:30,745 --> 00:04:31,625
Why?

43
00:04:33,305 --> 00:04:35,705
Because I believe we all have a value
and a place we need to be.

44
00:04:35,785 --> 00:04:37,865
Where there is a risk,
there is an opportunity too.

45
00:04:38,465 --> 00:04:40,865
I'm still young. I want to take the risk.

46
00:04:40,945 --> 00:04:43,585
I'm also aware
that given my average skills,

47
00:04:43,665 --> 00:04:45,545
I won't be able to pick up an S+ project

48
00:04:45,625 --> 00:04:47,665
unless it is very far away.

49
00:04:50,185 --> 00:04:53,305
Shang Zhitao, you won't admit this,

50
00:04:54,025 --> 00:04:55,265
but you are selling yourself short.

51
00:04:55,345 --> 00:04:57,785
You want to tread off the beaten path

52
00:04:59,185 --> 00:05:01,265
and hope it may lead to success.

53
00:05:03,105 --> 00:05:05,705
But someone has to make
the path first, right?

54
00:05:05,785 --> 00:05:09,385
No one wants to make this path, but I do.

55
00:05:10,145 --> 00:05:12,105
Luke. Can you approve it?

56
00:05:12,785 --> 00:05:14,465
This is also on my wishlist.

57
00:05:17,145 --> 00:05:19,145
I have a wishlist.

58
00:05:22,825 --> 00:05:25,145
I really want the expert title.

59
00:05:32,785 --> 00:05:33,625
Fine.

60
00:05:34,305 --> 00:05:35,145
As you wish.

61
00:05:37,105 --> 00:05:38,025
Okay.

62
00:05:38,105 --> 00:05:39,025
Thanks.

63
00:05:41,585 --> 00:05:42,705
What about Luke then?

64
00:05:49,385 --> 00:05:50,305
I haven't thought about it.

65
00:05:50,385 --> 00:05:51,665
When push comes to shove,
I'll bring him with me.

66
00:05:55,065 --> 00:05:56,265
You can let him live with me.

67
00:05:57,305 --> 00:05:58,825
He knows my place well anyway.

68
00:06:01,505 --> 00:06:02,865
I wouldn't want to trouble you,
But thanks.

69
00:06:26,985 --> 00:06:27,945
So…

70
00:06:29,545 --> 00:06:30,705
You broke up?

71
00:06:32,625 --> 00:06:33,505
I don't know.

72
00:06:36,185 --> 00:06:37,585
I guess so.

73
00:06:38,585 --> 00:06:42,385
He rejected me,
but I wasn't embarrassed or anything.

74
00:06:43,185 --> 00:06:44,385
And I do not resent him either.

75
00:06:45,225 --> 00:06:48,425
Now I've become an emotionless workaholic.

76
00:06:52,465 --> 00:06:54,305
Perhaps you didn't love him that much.

77
00:06:55,705 --> 00:06:56,865
Or perhaps

78
00:06:58,665 --> 00:07:00,785
a true heartbreak is always silent.

79
00:07:04,025 --> 00:07:05,665
Or perhaps…

80
00:07:10,865 --> 00:07:13,785
Or perhaps we have never fallen in love.

81
00:07:20,385 --> 00:07:22,865
Even though we were in a relationship,

82
00:07:25,025 --> 00:07:26,305
it was never real.

83
00:07:33,145 --> 00:07:34,425
I don't think it's gastric.

84
00:07:35,905 --> 00:07:37,705
I just feel a bit bloated.

85
00:07:39,145 --> 00:07:42,025
Wait. Are you still with that girl?

86
00:07:42,625 --> 00:07:44,785
Did you use protection?

87
00:07:45,545 --> 00:07:46,465
What are you saying?

88
00:07:47,145 --> 00:07:47,985
Just be frank.

89
00:07:48,065 --> 00:07:49,385
All right then.

90
00:07:49,465 --> 00:07:51,665
Did you contract any STDs?

91
00:07:53,465 --> 00:07:55,585
I'm about to be as chaste as a monk.

92
00:08:04,305 --> 00:08:06,305
SHANG ZHITAO

93
00:08:10,185 --> 00:08:11,225
Yes?

94
00:08:11,745 --> 00:08:16,065
Is Luke's rabies
vaccine certificate with you?

95
00:08:18,505 --> 00:08:20,625
Yes. I have it.

96
00:08:22,105 --> 00:08:24,305
But I'm sick now. I can't go out.

97
00:08:25,385 --> 00:08:26,345
Why don't you drop by my place?

98
00:08:27,465 --> 00:08:29,545
Get me some medicine.
I'll send the brand to you.

99
00:08:52,785 --> 00:08:53,785
Luke.

100
00:08:59,905 --> 00:09:00,785
Are you okay?

101
00:09:00,865 --> 00:09:02,985
Where does it hurt? You're in pain.

102
00:09:03,065 --> 00:09:04,385
Are you sure the medicine will help?

103
00:09:04,465 --> 00:09:05,505
Let's go to the hospital.

104
00:09:08,185 --> 00:09:09,665
I don't like hospitals.

105
00:09:16,505 --> 00:09:17,745
It hurts so much.

106
00:09:18,425 --> 00:09:19,545
I can't find the vaccine certificate.

107
00:09:23,705 --> 00:09:25,305
It's too late for you to get one anyway.

108
00:09:27,585 --> 00:09:31,105
I don't like to owe anyone a favor.
Given that you brought medicine for me,

109
00:09:32,905 --> 00:09:33,825
fine,

110
00:09:34,345 --> 00:09:35,545
I'll take care of Luke for you.

111
00:09:36,905 --> 00:09:39,465
You… You're sick,

112
00:09:39,545 --> 00:09:41,865
And I've already checked your schedule.

113
00:09:41,945 --> 00:09:43,905
You have a business trip next week.

114
00:09:44,945 --> 00:09:46,785
Your flatmates also have business trips.

115
00:09:47,625 --> 00:09:49,425
Besides, my neighborhood
has a dedicated dog sitter.

116
00:10:03,065 --> 00:10:05,665
NORTHWESTERN CHINA

117
00:10:05,745 --> 00:10:06,785
Sun Yuanzhu.

118
00:10:07,865 --> 00:10:09,865
You have lost a lot of weight.

119
00:10:09,945 --> 00:10:11,905
Is the food here that bad?

120
00:10:13,505 --> 00:10:15,145
No, it's good.

121
00:10:15,225 --> 00:10:16,985
I have been busy, that's all.

122
00:10:18,265 --> 00:10:19,705
Then, I shouldn't have
asked you to pick me up.

123
00:10:19,785 --> 00:10:21,105
No way.

124
00:10:21,905 --> 00:10:24,385
Tao. I'm so happy that you're here.

125
00:10:25,665 --> 00:10:29,025
Following your footsteps,
I have come here to achieve my ambition.

126
00:10:29,105 --> 00:10:34,025
I, Ms. Shang Zhitao,
will be working with the local councils

127
00:10:34,625 --> 00:10:37,385
as the project director of Lime.

128
00:10:37,465 --> 00:10:42,145
I will combine the local culture
and digital technology

129
00:10:42,225 --> 00:10:45,145
to develop a new cultural tourism.
What do you think? Is that impressive?

130
00:10:45,785 --> 00:10:48,625
Ms. Shang Zhitao,
you have become a bigwig.

131
00:10:48,705 --> 00:10:49,625
Yes.

132
00:10:51,625 --> 00:10:54,705
May your project
become a huge success soon.

133
00:10:54,785 --> 00:10:56,985
May your self-driving car

134
00:10:58,305 --> 00:11:00,105
go on the street soon.

135
00:11:01,145 --> 00:11:02,185
Okay.

136
00:11:06,025 --> 00:11:09,505
Sun Yuanzhu. This is such
a special mountain range.

137
00:11:10,785 --> 00:11:12,665
It's the spine of a dragon.

138
00:11:14,345 --> 00:11:15,425
A dragon spine?

139
00:11:35,145 --> 00:11:36,745
When I asked
to take on this distant project,

140
00:11:36,825 --> 00:11:38,265
some said it was beyond my capability.

141
00:11:38,345 --> 00:11:39,625
Some said I was trying
too hard to impress.

142
00:11:40,145 --> 00:11:43,105
But I know very well
that when I look down,

143
00:11:43,825 --> 00:11:45,745
it is to make sure
I am walking the right path.

144
00:11:46,785 --> 00:11:47,705
I'm so glad I'm here.

145
00:11:48,225 --> 00:11:50,745
NORTHWESTERN CHINA LAND LAW DRAFT

146
00:12:15,465 --> 00:12:17,745
SECTION EIGHT
PROPERTY OWNERSHIP RESOLUTION

147
00:12:18,385 --> 00:12:20,185
I used to think working

148
00:12:20,265 --> 00:12:22,425
was drinking with the right person
at a business dinner.

149
00:12:22,945 --> 00:12:24,265
But now I learned

150
00:12:24,785 --> 00:12:27,865
that the real battle
takes place where no one is around.

151
00:12:29,545 --> 00:12:31,905
THREE MONTHS LATER

152
00:12:36,185 --> 00:12:37,865
It represents our ideal.

153
00:12:40,505 --> 00:12:41,545
-Our idea…
-Flora.

154
00:12:41,625 --> 00:12:43,505
Mr. Luan has arrived. Come.

155
00:12:43,585 --> 00:12:44,465
Okay.

156
00:13:00,465 --> 00:13:02,025
-Flora.
-Lumi.

157
00:13:03,425 --> 00:13:04,745
I've missed you.

158
00:13:07,865 --> 00:13:08,865
Allow me to introduce.

159
00:13:10,385 --> 00:13:12,225
This is Flora, our project director
in Northwestern China.

160
00:13:12,945 --> 00:13:14,705
Flora. Our new colleague.

161
00:13:14,785 --> 00:13:15,665
Yilia.

162
00:13:16,265 --> 00:13:18,105
Flora. We finally meet.

163
00:13:18,185 --> 00:13:20,025
People have been
praising you at the office.

164
00:13:20,105 --> 00:13:21,065
I can't wait to learn from you.

165
00:13:21,145 --> 00:13:22,345
Likewise.

166
00:13:23,545 --> 00:13:25,665
It's about time. Come in.

167
00:13:33,185 --> 00:13:34,425
She's an elite who joined our division

168
00:13:34,505 --> 00:13:36,665
all the way
from the headquarters in the US.

169
00:13:37,185 --> 00:13:38,265
She bought her way in.

170
00:13:39,345 --> 00:13:41,545
Is this project that important?

171
00:13:41,625 --> 00:13:43,265
Even a bigwig like her is here.

172
00:13:44,185 --> 00:13:46,425
Of course, you have
an influential figure backing you up.

173
00:13:46,945 --> 00:13:48,865
Luke's presence is the greatest privilege
you can have.

174
00:13:49,705 --> 00:13:50,545
And I'm here too.

175
00:13:51,825 --> 00:13:52,785
Come.

176
00:13:53,505 --> 00:13:56,025
We like dragons. We deify dragons.

177
00:13:56,105 --> 00:13:58,065
Dragons are like our ideals.

178
00:13:58,145 --> 00:14:00,585
Our idea should incorporate
this kind of ideal.

179
00:14:00,665 --> 00:14:03,545
Instead of focusing on the landscape,

180
00:14:03,625 --> 00:14:07,665
we should highlight
the generations that live here.

181
00:14:07,745 --> 00:14:10,545
There are sculptures.
There is cultural heritage.

182
00:14:11,585 --> 00:14:14,825
So what exactly is Northwestern China?

183
00:14:24,105 --> 00:14:26,225
NORTHWESTERN CULTURAL TOURISM

184
00:14:26,305 --> 00:14:27,665
TARGET AUDIENCES
WELLNESS SEEKERS &amp; FAMILY TRAVELERS

185
00:14:27,745 --> 00:14:28,385
TRENDY YOUTH &amp; NICHE EXPLORERS

186
00:14:36,705 --> 00:14:37,905
PRIMARY PALETTE &amp; ITS IMPACT

187
00:14:54,465 --> 00:14:56,385
That's all for my presentation.

188
00:14:56,465 --> 00:14:57,705
Thank you for listening.

189
00:15:10,305 --> 00:15:11,905
Please proceed to the lounge next to us.

190
00:15:11,985 --> 00:15:14,065
We have prepared food and refreshments.

191
00:15:23,745 --> 00:15:25,505
I have taught Flora well.

192
00:15:25,585 --> 00:15:27,145
She made me proud.

193
00:15:28,425 --> 00:15:29,585
She's so good.

194
00:15:29,665 --> 00:15:32,905
She recognizes, values,
and manages talents very well.

195
00:15:32,985 --> 00:15:33,945
She can do everything.

196
00:15:34,745 --> 00:15:37,345
Flora is indeed exceptional in Lime.

197
00:15:38,265 --> 00:15:40,465
She started from a humble background.
She has a clear goal

198
00:15:41,065 --> 00:15:41,985
and works hard.

199
00:15:42,545 --> 00:15:45,265
Her amicability is also
one of a kind in Lime.

200
00:15:45,345 --> 00:15:48,265
Many colleagues remarked
that her passion and honesty

201
00:15:49,185 --> 00:15:50,665
were exemplary attributes.

202
00:15:51,625 --> 00:15:52,665
You're a smooth-talker today.

203
00:15:58,545 --> 00:15:59,865
Go eat first.

204
00:16:00,385 --> 00:16:01,625
I'll talk to Flora for a while.

205
00:16:02,505 --> 00:16:03,785
Come. Let's eat.

206
00:16:09,105 --> 00:16:10,105
NORTHWESTERN CULTURAL TOURISM
CONFERENCE HALL, BREAK ROOM

207
00:16:21,105 --> 00:16:22,385
Are you okay?

208
00:16:25,385 --> 00:16:26,425
It hurts.

209
00:16:36,705 --> 00:16:39,105
Stop moving around. Okay?

210
00:16:39,185 --> 00:16:40,145
Sit properly.

211
00:16:42,425 --> 00:16:43,785
You'll be fine soon.

212
00:16:46,265 --> 00:16:48,305
Am I going to die here?

213
00:16:48,385 --> 00:16:49,585
What are you on about?

214
00:16:50,105 --> 00:16:51,425
This is a good hospital.

215
00:16:51,505 --> 00:16:53,305
Besides, I'm here.

216
00:16:57,225 --> 00:16:58,185
Are you thirsty?

217
00:17:04,184 --> 00:17:07,944
The doctor said
you shouldn't drink soda anymore.

218
00:17:08,025 --> 00:17:11,065
Once we're back, I'll throw away
your cola and soda.

219
00:17:11,585 --> 00:17:12,505
Are you hungry?

220
00:17:16,184 --> 00:17:17,424
It's just a kidney stone.

221
00:17:18,065 --> 00:17:19,305
I'm fine.

222
00:17:21,224 --> 00:17:22,944
Just a kidney stone?

223
00:17:23,025 --> 00:17:24,825
You're the one suffering here.

224
00:17:36,385 --> 00:17:38,265
Does it not hurt anymore?
Why are you smiling?

225
00:17:41,025 --> 00:17:42,025
Lie down.

226
00:18:53,265 --> 00:18:54,545
Don't tell Lumi and the rest.

227
00:18:58,025 --> 00:18:59,105
Just tell them I went back to Beijing.

228
00:18:59,945 --> 00:19:01,225
You won't stay at the hotel?

229
00:19:03,345 --> 00:19:05,665
No. I'm staying with you.

230
00:19:07,665 --> 00:19:09,105
I need a carer.

231
00:19:41,425 --> 00:19:42,345
Yes.

232
00:19:42,425 --> 00:19:43,305
It's not out yet.

233
00:19:44,185 --> 00:19:46,145
I had an X-ray yesterday.
The doctor said it was moving out.

234
00:19:47,545 --> 00:19:49,305
It'll come out if I raise
my calves or climb stairs more often.

235
00:19:51,985 --> 00:19:53,225
Don't worry.

236
00:19:53,305 --> 00:19:54,345
Someone is looking after me.

237
00:19:56,425 --> 00:19:57,425
Who, you asked?

238
00:19:59,105 --> 00:19:59,945
My girlfriend.

239
00:20:01,945 --> 00:20:03,065
Your girlfriend?

240
00:20:03,825 --> 00:20:05,665
Can I speak to her?

241
00:20:06,265 --> 00:20:08,865
I need to talk to her
about your condition.

242
00:20:10,105 --> 00:20:12,745
Or maybe I should fly
to Northwestern China and drag you back?

243
00:20:12,825 --> 00:20:14,825
You want to speak to my girlfriend?

244
00:20:15,425 --> 00:20:16,425
Okay.

245
00:20:17,505 --> 00:20:18,345
It's my mom.

246
00:20:19,065 --> 00:20:20,225
She thinks I have a terminal illness.

247
00:20:24,545 --> 00:20:25,825
Hi, Dr. Liang.

248
00:20:26,425 --> 00:20:27,305
Hi.

249
00:20:27,945 --> 00:20:29,785
Miss, how should I address you?

250
00:20:29,865 --> 00:20:31,305
Just call me Flora.

251
00:20:32,185 --> 00:20:33,225
Flora.

252
00:20:33,305 --> 00:20:34,865
I just want to know
about Luan Nian's condition.

253
00:20:35,465 --> 00:20:37,465
Is it true that he has a kidney stone?

254
00:20:38,505 --> 00:20:40,665
Yes, he has a kidney stone.

255
00:20:40,745 --> 00:20:41,785
Don't worry about him.

256
00:20:41,865 --> 00:20:45,945
Luke has already told you
what he needed to do.

257
00:20:46,025 --> 00:20:48,145
I'll take him
to get his X-ray done in a few days.

258
00:20:48,665 --> 00:20:49,505
So don't worry about it.

259
00:20:50,465 --> 00:20:51,465
Okay.

260
00:20:52,545 --> 00:20:55,585
Flora. I know Luan Nian has a bad temper

261
00:20:55,665 --> 00:20:56,865
and he can be quite weird.

262
00:20:56,945 --> 00:20:58,665
-But don't--
-Anyway,

263
00:20:58,745 --> 00:21:01,305
as you already know, I'm not dead.
I'm hanging up now.

264
00:21:04,505 --> 00:21:06,385
Make sure to take your medicine.
I have to work now.

265
00:21:08,385 --> 00:21:09,905
When are you coming back?

266
00:21:11,505 --> 00:21:12,585
As soon as possible.

267
00:21:51,865 --> 00:21:53,745
Why are you lying on the couch?

268
00:21:54,505 --> 00:21:55,425
You're back.

269
00:22:01,505 --> 00:22:02,465
The mattress is too firm.

270
00:22:03,505 --> 00:22:05,745
The comforter is not soft enough.
And it's too thick.

271
00:22:06,345 --> 00:22:07,625
The pillow is too low.

272
00:22:09,105 --> 00:22:10,265
Are you a princess or what?

273
00:22:12,345 --> 00:22:14,025
You know what?
I'll get you a room in a hotel.

274
00:22:14,105 --> 00:22:15,665
But you won't stay
in the same hotel as Lumi.

275
00:22:15,745 --> 00:22:16,745
Is that okay?

276
00:22:17,865 --> 00:22:19,265
No.

277
00:22:19,345 --> 00:22:21,305
I just feel quite weak.

278
00:22:21,385 --> 00:22:22,385
It hurts everywhere.

279
00:22:24,025 --> 00:22:26,345
I'll just rest in the room. I'll lie down.

280
00:22:36,505 --> 00:22:38,025
Maybe you should return to Beijing.

281
00:22:38,545 --> 00:22:40,185
They have big hospitals there.

282
00:22:40,265 --> 00:22:41,705
You won't have to wait as long.

283
00:22:41,785 --> 00:22:42,985
I can't go back.

284
00:22:43,065 --> 00:22:44,465
Even getting out of bed
takes a lot of effort.

285
00:22:44,545 --> 00:22:45,785
I need time to recover.

286
00:22:47,625 --> 00:22:49,305
I bought a free-range chicken.

287
00:22:49,385 --> 00:22:50,665
Should I cook it for you?

288
00:22:55,385 --> 00:22:56,625
Are you sure I won't be poisoned?

289
00:22:58,025 --> 00:22:59,545
I can assure you
that it will be cooked thoroughly.

290
00:23:00,625 --> 00:23:03,585
You will do it an injustice
if it's not delicious enough.

291
00:23:08,305 --> 00:23:09,345
Let me cook.

292
00:23:11,705 --> 00:23:13,865
You… Aren't you sick?

293
00:23:15,825 --> 00:23:16,705
I can hang in there.

294
00:23:28,985 --> 00:23:29,945
Come. Drink some soup.

295
00:23:33,385 --> 00:23:34,425
Try it.

296
00:23:37,225 --> 00:23:38,425
I can do this myself.

297
00:23:39,385 --> 00:23:40,425
Just drink it.

298
00:23:48,385 --> 00:23:49,465
What do you think?

299
00:23:51,625 --> 00:23:52,945
It's good.

300
00:23:54,105 --> 00:23:55,545
I'll give you a shopping list tomorrow.

301
00:23:55,625 --> 00:23:57,225
Let's furnish the kitchen.

302
00:23:58,065 --> 00:24:01,105
You know I don't cook here.

303
00:24:03,585 --> 00:24:04,865
I can when I'm here.

304
00:24:12,265 --> 00:24:13,465
How long are you staying here?

305
00:24:15,025 --> 00:24:15,905
Until I recover.

306
00:24:26,585 --> 00:24:27,505
Does it still hurt?

307
00:24:31,105 --> 00:24:32,345
Occasionally.

308
00:24:34,305 --> 00:24:37,425
After you eat, do some calf raises.

309
00:25:23,625 --> 00:25:24,585
So?

310
00:25:24,665 --> 00:25:26,905
How is my performance as a househusband?

311
00:25:31,905 --> 00:25:33,185
Have you peed your kidney stone out?

312
00:25:37,145 --> 00:25:38,305
I don't know.

313
00:25:38,385 --> 00:25:39,745
But it doesn't hurt as much anymore.

314
00:25:43,505 --> 00:25:44,865
Then, return to Beijing tomorrow.

315
00:25:49,545 --> 00:25:50,705
I have taken a long leave.

316
00:26:00,745 --> 00:26:01,745
Shang Zhitao.

317
00:26:03,145 --> 00:26:04,385
You told me last time

318
00:26:04,465 --> 00:26:06,225
that you were young,
so you wanted to take the risk.

319
00:26:09,785 --> 00:26:11,025
Let's take another leap of faith.

320
00:26:31,345 --> 00:26:33,585
I don't want to take the old path.

321
00:26:38,625 --> 00:26:39,545
We are not doing that.

322
00:26:40,825 --> 00:26:42,185
I'll come with you.

323
00:26:43,825 --> 00:26:44,985
You can take me anywhere you want.

324
00:26:55,585 --> 00:26:56,465
Shang Zhitao.

325
00:26:57,185 --> 00:26:58,225
Luke has missed you a lot.

326
00:26:59,185 --> 00:27:03,025
Whenever we do a video call,
Luke just rushes to me

327
00:27:03,825 --> 00:27:05,105
whenever he hears you.

328
00:27:07,505 --> 00:27:09,065
He's more honest than I am.

329
00:27:10,105 --> 00:27:11,545
So, let me be honest with you.

330
00:27:12,905 --> 00:27:14,545
After we broke up,

331
00:27:15,185 --> 00:27:16,265
I felt awful.

332
00:27:17,465 --> 00:27:19,985
It's as if I've lost
something precious to me.

333
00:27:26,345 --> 00:27:28,025
I'm not good with words.

334
00:27:29,745 --> 00:27:30,785
But I know I miss you.

335
00:27:32,185 --> 00:27:33,105
I want to see you.

336
00:27:35,225 --> 00:27:36,705
I want to take a leap of faith with you.

337
00:27:39,465 --> 00:27:41,105
I want to see
if I can make it work between us.

338
00:27:44,305 --> 00:27:46,265
I have thought about our future.

339
00:27:49,225 --> 00:27:50,865
Can we start over again?

340
00:27:53,425 --> 00:27:54,265
Tao.

341
00:27:55,305 --> 00:27:57,025
Tell me. Do you not miss me?

342
00:28:21,065 --> 00:28:22,105
You're so annoying.

343
00:28:26,345 --> 00:28:27,225
You're so annoying.

344
00:28:28,785 --> 00:28:31,265
I have missed you so much.

345
00:28:48,745 --> 00:28:49,705
Shang Zhitao.

346
00:28:51,425 --> 00:28:52,305
Come back to Beijing with me.

347
00:28:57,985 --> 00:28:59,025
Come.

348
00:28:59,785 --> 00:29:00,945
Come back to Beijing with me.

349
00:29:05,225 --> 00:29:07,425
In what capacity
are you talking to me right now?

350
00:29:12,585 --> 00:29:13,905
If you're speaking as my boyfriend,

351
00:29:15,025 --> 00:29:18,585
I'll turn you down
because I like this project a lot.

352
00:29:19,305 --> 00:29:23,465
I want to see it through,
and I hope you'll respect my choice.

353
00:29:26,225 --> 00:29:28,505
If you're speaking as my boss,

354
00:29:30,545 --> 00:29:33,105
then I'll come back.
Because you're my boss.

355
00:29:34,705 --> 00:29:36,665
But I think it's a shame.

356
00:29:37,385 --> 00:29:39,105
I don't know

357
00:29:39,185 --> 00:29:41,665
if I'll ever have
a similar opportunity again in the future.

358
00:29:41,745 --> 00:29:44,745
This is the only shot
that will most likely change my life.

359
00:30:06,865 --> 00:30:08,305
Let's travel together.

360
00:30:09,025 --> 00:30:10,185
Where to?

361
00:30:11,385 --> 00:30:13,545
We'll bring the dog with us
and go wherever we want.

362
00:30:30,385 --> 00:30:31,985
Where are we going next?

363
00:30:34,145 --> 00:30:34,985
To Tibet, China.

364
00:30:36,665 --> 00:30:37,545
Tibet, China?

365
00:30:39,865 --> 00:30:41,305
What if I have altitude sickness?

366
00:30:42,745 --> 00:30:44,105
We have oxygen bottles.

367
00:30:44,705 --> 00:30:47,865
If I have altitude sickness,
will you look after me?

368
00:30:47,945 --> 00:30:49,145
If you have altitude sickness,

369
00:30:50,665 --> 00:30:52,225
I'll sell you off.

370
00:31:00,225 --> 00:31:01,905
-It's dangerous.
-Come here.

371
00:31:09,025 --> 00:31:10,105
Why are you staring at me?

372
00:31:13,185 --> 00:31:17,145
You are so gentle today.

373
00:31:19,585 --> 00:31:20,945
Have I ever hit you?

374
00:31:21,025 --> 00:31:22,265
No.

375
00:31:23,425 --> 00:31:25,145
I just wish you could be

376
00:31:26,505 --> 00:31:28,305
this gentle with me more often.

377
00:31:31,905 --> 00:31:33,225
So you like someone who's soft.

378
00:31:34,665 --> 00:31:35,825
Luan Nian.

379
00:31:35,905 --> 00:31:37,105
Do you know?

380
00:31:37,185 --> 00:31:38,905
I think you should know this.

381
00:31:39,905 --> 00:31:41,145
What?

382
00:31:42,105 --> 00:31:44,065
I love to travel with you.

383
00:31:46,185 --> 00:31:47,385
That's all?

384
00:31:47,905 --> 00:31:49,625
Anything you want to add?

385
00:31:58,265 --> 00:31:59,225
Luan Nian.

386
00:32:01,385 --> 00:32:03,465
I love every path you take.

387
00:32:06,145 --> 00:32:07,625
I love to go on an adventure with you.

388
00:32:10,785 --> 00:32:12,465
I love the landscape on this journey.

389
00:32:13,625 --> 00:32:15,465
Because we're doing it together.

390
00:32:52,305 --> 00:32:54,465
MOM

391
00:32:54,545 --> 00:32:56,825
-It's my mom.
-Pick it up.

392
00:32:58,785 --> 00:32:59,665
Mom.

393
00:32:59,745 --> 00:33:02,785
Why didn't you go on the trip
with Song Qiuhan and the rest?

394
00:33:03,825 --> 00:33:05,625
I changed my mind. I have a road trip now.

395
00:33:06,345 --> 00:33:07,385
A road trip?

396
00:33:08,585 --> 00:33:09,465
With Flora?

397
00:33:10,465 --> 00:33:11,745
You sure have a good memory.

398
00:33:12,585 --> 00:33:13,785
I'm driving. I'll call you back

399
00:33:13,865 --> 00:33:16,905
-when we take a break in the city.
-No need.

400
00:33:16,985 --> 00:33:18,825
You're having fun right now.

401
00:33:18,905 --> 00:33:20,105
No need to call me.

402
00:33:20,185 --> 00:33:23,065
Just text me to tell me you're safe.

403
00:33:24,465 --> 00:33:25,585
Flora.

404
00:33:27,025 --> 00:33:28,385
Yes, Dr. Liang?

405
00:33:28,465 --> 00:33:30,105
Luan Nian has a bad temper.

406
00:33:30,705 --> 00:33:33,225
And he can be quite weird.
Thank you for putting up with him.

407
00:33:33,305 --> 00:33:35,585
But don't take it lying down.

408
00:33:35,665 --> 00:33:37,425
-If he does something wrong, you--
-Anyway.

409
00:33:37,505 --> 00:33:40,265
I have a good temper. And I am not weird.

410
00:33:40,945 --> 00:33:41,945
Bye.

411
00:33:46,025 --> 00:33:47,505
Not weird, you said?

412
00:33:53,025 --> 00:33:55,745
I think our son is in love.

413
00:33:55,825 --> 00:33:58,825
And I think he really loves her.

414
00:34:01,585 --> 00:34:03,545
It's just a trip. How is it real?

415
00:34:04,065 --> 00:34:06,665
He was with Zang Yao for a decade.
Did he fall in love with her?

416
00:34:08,264 --> 00:34:09,505
Honestly,

417
00:34:09,585 --> 00:34:13,264
businessmen like you
only know how to do business.

418
00:34:14,264 --> 00:34:16,505
Has he ever gone out with Zang Yao alone?

419
00:34:17,625 --> 00:34:18,824
Also,

420
00:34:18,905 --> 00:34:22,465
Luan Nian even admitted
that she was his girlfriend.

421
00:34:22,545 --> 00:34:23,425
Has he ever done that?

422
00:34:24,824 --> 00:34:28,025
You are just too eager
to be a grandmother.

423
00:34:29,065 --> 00:34:30,185
Listen.

424
00:34:30,264 --> 00:34:31,705
Don't be too eager.

425
00:34:32,225 --> 00:34:34,545
Don't get your hopes up

426
00:34:34,625 --> 00:34:36,585
because Luan Nian
has always been like this.

427
00:34:36,665 --> 00:34:39,705
-He will mess things up.
-And he got that from you.

428
00:34:41,264 --> 00:34:42,705
If only he were more like me.

429
00:35:42,465 --> 00:35:43,705
Do you want to take photos?

430
00:35:43,785 --> 00:35:44,785
You can pick your costumes inside.

431
00:35:45,505 --> 00:35:46,625
Let me see.

432
00:35:51,425 --> 00:35:54,665
Luan Nian. Do you like the photos here?

433
00:35:55,225 --> 00:35:56,065
I do.

434
00:35:56,585 --> 00:35:57,785
But I won't take them.

435
00:36:01,265 --> 00:36:02,305
Sir.

436
00:36:02,385 --> 00:36:04,025
Do you… Do you have a model here?

437
00:36:04,905 --> 00:36:07,425
A male model
to take a couple of photos with me.

438
00:36:08,065 --> 00:36:09,465
Yes.

439
00:36:09,545 --> 00:36:10,985
You just have to pay extra.

440
00:36:11,065 --> 00:36:12,305
Let me show you.

441
00:36:12,385 --> 00:36:13,705
Young Tibetan men.

442
00:36:13,785 --> 00:36:15,185
-Really?
-They are very handsome.

443
00:36:15,265 --> 00:36:17,025
I want a handsome one

444
00:36:17,105 --> 00:36:18,785
-to take photos, like--
-Shang Zhitao.

445
00:36:24,345 --> 00:36:25,345
Which one do you want?

446
00:36:28,065 --> 00:36:28,985
You pick one first.

447
00:36:49,945 --> 00:36:51,265
Okay. Great.

448
00:36:52,105 --> 00:36:53,265
Stay.

449
00:36:53,345 --> 00:36:54,345
Hold it higher.

450
00:36:54,425 --> 00:36:56,545
Yes! Great. This is good.

451
00:36:59,305 --> 00:37:00,785
Two more single photos.

452
00:37:02,625 --> 00:37:04,065
Your husband can join now.

453
00:37:14,145 --> 00:37:16,185
-Stand here?
-Yes.

454
00:37:20,865 --> 00:37:22,465
Stand closer to your wife.

455
00:37:26,345 --> 00:37:29,145
Yes. Hug your wife.

456
00:37:31,865 --> 00:37:32,705
Yes.

457
00:37:34,105 --> 00:37:36,305
Don't be so stiff, you two.

458
00:37:36,385 --> 00:37:38,345
Just relax.

459
00:37:39,785 --> 00:37:42,225
Too stiff. Aren't you always
soft and relaxed?

460
00:37:47,745 --> 00:37:50,025
Wonderful. Good.

461
00:37:50,705 --> 00:37:53,305
Closer. Yes!

462
00:38:10,665 --> 00:38:12,985
Good. Let's pick your photos here.

463
00:38:23,585 --> 00:38:24,625
Come here already.

464
00:38:30,305 --> 00:38:31,545
So gentle.

465
00:38:31,625 --> 00:38:33,385
Is this the Luan Nian I know?

466
00:38:34,625 --> 00:38:37,625
It feels like
we're dating for real this time.

467
00:38:53,705 --> 00:38:54,585
Eat now, Luke.

468
00:38:57,345 --> 00:38:59,665
He's so fat now. Stop feeding him.

469
00:38:59,745 --> 00:39:00,585
Drink some water.

470
00:39:02,305 --> 00:39:03,385
Thanks.

471
00:39:12,585 --> 00:39:16,625
I appreciate that you never
threw tantrums at me.

472
00:39:16,705 --> 00:39:19,825
You didn't leave me behind on the streets.

473
00:39:19,905 --> 00:39:20,865
Congratulations.

474
00:39:20,945 --> 00:39:24,105
You have become someone I trust.

475
00:39:26,265 --> 00:39:28,865
-That's my honor.
-Of course.

476
00:39:37,265 --> 00:39:40,425
-Mom.
-How is Tibet, China?

477
00:39:40,505 --> 00:39:41,985
I love it here.

478
00:39:42,065 --> 00:39:44,465
I eat well. I sleep well.

479
00:39:44,545 --> 00:39:45,625
The scenery here is beautiful.

480
00:39:46,545 --> 00:39:47,625
Luke is happy too.

481
00:39:50,825 --> 00:39:52,305
Who are you traveling with?

482
00:39:52,385 --> 00:39:53,905
Your boyfriend?

483
00:39:56,545 --> 00:39:58,505
Yes. My boyfriend.

484
00:40:02,145 --> 00:40:04,065
When did this happen?

485
00:40:04,145 --> 00:40:05,865
-Who is he?
-Yes. Who?

486
00:40:05,945 --> 00:40:07,225
How is his family?

487
00:40:07,305 --> 00:40:09,105
How are his parents?

488
00:40:09,185 --> 00:40:10,185
Is he kind?

489
00:40:10,985 --> 00:40:12,865
Hi, Mrs. Shang. I am Luan Nian.

490
00:40:18,065 --> 00:40:22,705
Hi. We are on the phone
together with Tao's dad.

491
00:40:22,785 --> 00:40:24,345
-You are Mr. Luan, right?
-Give me that.

492
00:40:24,425 --> 00:40:25,305
Yes, Mrs. Shang.

493
00:40:25,385 --> 00:40:27,065
Tao and I have been dating for six years.

494
00:40:29,345 --> 00:40:30,425
My family is okay.

495
00:40:30,505 --> 00:40:31,585
-My annual income is--
-Enough.

496
00:40:32,865 --> 00:40:34,265
Mom. I…

497
00:40:34,345 --> 00:40:36,185
I'll talk to you later. Bye.

498
00:40:37,505 --> 00:40:38,585
He hasn't even finished.

499
00:40:41,825 --> 00:40:43,265
Why are you scared?

500
00:40:43,345 --> 00:40:44,225
Too ashamed to tell anyone?

501
00:40:44,305 --> 00:40:45,785
No.

502
00:40:45,865 --> 00:40:47,465
I just…

503
00:40:51,265 --> 00:40:52,225
Yes?

504
00:41:04,385 --> 00:41:05,665
Luan Nian.

505
00:41:11,585 --> 00:41:12,505
What?

506
00:41:33,465 --> 00:41:34,545
Luke is here.

507
00:41:38,545 --> 00:41:40,185
And you have altitude sickness. Be nice.

508
00:41:46,985 --> 00:41:48,905
I think I'm fine.

509
00:41:48,985 --> 00:41:50,145
I don't have altitude sickness.

510
00:41:50,225 --> 00:41:51,625
Right.

511
00:41:53,145 --> 00:41:55,545
Smooth your breathing first.

512
00:41:56,745 --> 00:41:59,185
If something happens to you,
I'll have to collect your body.

513
00:42:01,465 --> 00:42:03,425
Then, can we talk?

514
00:42:05,625 --> 00:42:06,465
About what?

515
00:42:09,465 --> 00:42:10,865
Let's talk

516
00:42:11,785 --> 00:42:13,465
about the first time we met.

517
00:42:15,865 --> 00:42:17,385
The first time we met?

518
00:42:19,345 --> 00:42:20,185
In the office?

519
00:42:20,985 --> 00:42:22,585
No.

520
00:42:22,665 --> 00:42:23,585
You don't remember?

521
00:42:23,665 --> 00:42:24,865
Where was it then?

522
00:42:24,945 --> 00:42:26,225
In the hall.

523
00:42:27,025 --> 00:42:31,665
I was like, how could someone
be this handsome?

524
00:42:31,745 --> 00:42:33,825
You're the most handsome man I've met.

525
00:42:34,425 --> 00:42:35,785
Your turn now.

526
00:42:35,865 --> 00:42:36,785
Tell me.

527
00:42:38,105 --> 00:42:41,905
When I first met you, I was thinking,
how could someone be this dumb?

528
00:42:44,665 --> 00:42:46,545
Like a big dummy.

529
00:42:50,145 --> 00:42:51,065
I'm tired now.

530
00:42:52,865 --> 00:42:54,265
-Mad?
-No.

531
00:42:54,345 --> 00:42:55,345
I'm just sleepy.

532
00:42:57,025 --> 00:42:58,025
Shang Zhitao.

533
00:42:59,865 --> 00:43:01,345
Should we catch the aurora next year?

534
00:43:04,745 --> 00:43:06,065
I'll go

535
00:43:07,305 --> 00:43:08,945
wherever you go.

536
00:43:18,665 --> 00:43:22,345
This year is a good year.

537
00:43:40,145 --> 00:43:41,305
I love this photo.

538
00:43:42,505 --> 00:43:43,905
This one too.

539
00:43:45,305 --> 00:43:46,545
This one is good.

540
00:43:46,625 --> 00:43:49,945
This one is good.
You're a good photographer.

541
00:43:50,825 --> 00:43:51,785
Thank you.

542
00:43:51,865 --> 00:43:53,185
I want all of them.

543
00:43:53,265 --> 00:43:54,385
We'll take everything then.

544
00:43:54,465 --> 00:43:55,545
How much more should we pay?

545
00:43:56,265 --> 00:43:57,265
No need to pay extra.

546
00:43:57,345 --> 00:43:59,665
Can I hang one in my shop?

547
00:43:59,745 --> 00:44:00,945
Then, you'll have to pay us.

548
00:44:05,305 --> 00:44:06,625
Pick one

549
00:44:06,705 --> 00:44:08,145
and hang it
at the most visible place in the shop.

550
00:44:08,225 --> 00:44:09,825
Process it with the best film.

551
00:44:09,905 --> 00:44:11,105
Once you're done, I'll inspect it.

552
00:44:11,185 --> 00:44:13,145
Sure. No problem.

553
00:44:13,225 --> 00:44:14,745
I'll give you the original film.

554
00:44:14,825 --> 00:44:17,345
After I process it,
you can pick two as your wedding photos.

555
00:44:18,305 --> 00:44:19,625
It'll last for many years.

556
00:44:20,185 --> 00:44:22,625
The Tibetans use this
for their wedding photos.

557
00:44:24,225 --> 00:44:26,905
I highly doubt I can get
good photos like this again.

558
00:44:27,745 --> 00:44:28,705
Of course.

559
00:44:31,905 --> 00:44:33,425
I'll count on you
to process the films, then.

560
00:44:33,505 --> 00:44:34,505
Sure. Don't worry.

561
00:44:35,545 --> 00:44:36,465
Luan Nian.
